og on \\u0026 security settings’ under ‘My Profile’, choose “Change password” tab and follow the instructions. Then delete and reinstall the app.\",[1570010663,872000000]],null,[\"111219277873501596372\",\"A Google user\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EGemoI2NTXmTsBVtJqk8jxF9rh8ApRWfsIMQSt2uE4OcpQqbFu7f7NbTK05lx80nuSijCz7sc3a277R67g\"]]],[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yq7oyNIvAAkuc69fG51sbAQS4otJxbObbt3xdr8tXxXyUdq4tVGtfgeKuptveGdP1srxaHVrNPzOYcfaEQ\"]]],\"2.15.0\",null,null,null,null,null,1],[\"3b489df6-97cb-4157-b8f1-105cc0a7e5fa\",[\"A Google user\",[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EGemoI2NTXmTsBVtJqk8jxF9rh8ApRWfsIMQSt2uE4OcpQqbFu7f7NbTK05lx80nuSijCz7sc3a277R67g\"]]],1,null,\"Fingerprint not supported after upgrading to andoird 10 on pixel 2. Please fix!!\",[1569514430,273000000],0,[\"The Hongkong and Shanghai Banking Corporation Ltd\",\"Hi Keith, we’re sorry you're having trouble with the app.\\nIf you've previously set up your memorable answer and second password, delete and reinstall the app.\\nIf you haven't, logon Internet Banking, select 'Log on \\u0026 security settings' under 'My Profile', choose \\\"Change password\\\" tab and follow the instructions. Then delete and reinstall the app.\",[1569553313,950000000]],null,[\"101629162144724676425\",\"A Google user\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EGemoI2NTXmTsBVtJqk8jxF9rh8ApRWfsIMQSt2uE4OcpQqbFu7f7NbTK05lx80nuSijCz7sc3a277R67g\"]]],[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yq7oyNIvAAkuc69fG51sbAQS4otJxbObbt3xdr8tXxXyUdq4tVGtfgeKuptveGdP1srxaHVrNPzOYcfaEQ\"]]],\"2.27.0\",null,null,null,null,null,1],[\"f12cd25d-c467-4f0d-9618-d4b240967c6d\",[\"A Google user\",[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EGemoI2NTXmTsBVtJqk8jxF9rh8ApRWfsIMQSt2uE4OcpQqbFu7f7NbTK05lx80nuSijCz7sc3a277R67g\"]]],3,null,\"Once I upgraded my pixel 2 xl to android 10, the apps cannot use the fingerprint login, it keeps on said the fingerprint was in error and mismatch. it was fine when at android 9\",[1569485598,420000000],1,[\"The Hongkong and Shanghai Banking Corporation Ltd\",\"Hi Sammy,\\nIf you've previously set up your memorable answer and second password, delete and reinstall the app.\\nIf you haven't, logon Online Banking, select 'Log on \\u0026 security settings' under 'My Profile', choose \\\"Change password\\\" tab and follow the instructions. Then delete and reinstall the app.\\nYou can activate Android™ Fingerprint ID afterwards.\",[1569568037,637000000]],null,[\"115608551710109766120\",\"A Google user\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EGemoI2NTXmTsBVtJqk8jxF9rh8ApRWfsIMQSt2uE4OcpQqbFu7f7NbTK05lx80nuSijCz7sc3a277R67g\"]]],[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yq7oyNIvAAkuc69fG51sbAQS4otJxbObbt3xdr8tXxXyUdq4tVGtfgeKuptveGdP1srxaHVrNPzOYcfaEQ\"]]],\"2.27.0\",null,null,null,null,null,1],[\"07bd7562-2a1d-4890-b17b-0ffb7d182ca9\",[\"A Google user\",[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EGemoI2NTXmTsBVtJqk8jxF9rh8ApRWfsIMQSt2uE4OcpQqbFu7f7NbTK05lx80nuSijCz7sc3a277R67g\"]]],4,null,\"After Android 10 update, I'm unable to login either with Fingerprint nor Mobile Password. Have to use a computer to access for now. Hurry and update this app please. Edited 9/26: Deleting and Reinstalling app, then going thru the mobile activation process worked as suggested as a work around. Thanks.\",[1569463217,331000000],6,[\"The Hongkong and Shanghai Banking Corporation Ltd\",\"Hi Arnold, we're sorry you're having trouble with the app.\\nIf you've previously set up your memorable answer and second password, delete and reinstall the app.\\nIf you haven't, logon Internet Banking, select 'Log on \\u0026 security settings' under 'My Profile', choose \\\"Change password\\\" tab and follow the instructions. Then delete and reinstall the app.\",